Section: libs
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: Freedreno OpenGL and Turnip drivers for the OnePlus Pad 2 Pro
 Private Mesa libraries with the upstream Adreno 830v1 device entry.
 The dynamic linker selects these libraries system-wide, including programs
 that clear their environment. Softpipe provides software rendering when
 the GPU is unavailable. Ubuntu retains ownership of its GLVND dispatcher
 and distribution libraries. Includes desktop OpenGL, GLES and experimental
 Vulkan. Installation and removal update the library cache for new processes.
